<div style="text-align:center">
  <div style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.7rem;letter-spacing:.04em;color:#E9ECF2">FRET<span style="color:#CBA96A">WORK</span></div>
  <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.34em;color:#CBA96A;margin-top:4px">SYSTEMS · CONNECTED</div>
</div></div>
</div></section>

<!-- METRICS -->
<section class="metrics"><div class="wrap" style="grid-template-columns:1fr">
  <p style="text-align:center;max-width:74ch;margin:0 auto;padding:26px 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.65;background:var(--bg)">Fretwork is early &mdash; so instead of borrowed numbers, here's what we hold to: scoped audits, systems running in weeks not quarters, and human QA on everything we ship. We'll publish real client outcomes here as engagements land.</p>
</div></section>

<!-- PROBLEM -->
<section class="band problem"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">The problem</div>
  <p style="margin-top:16px">Most teams run on a pile of disconnected tools and manual handoffs. The work leaks out between the apps &mdash; and &ldquo;adopt AI&rdquo; usually means <b>one more thing that doesn&rsquo;t talk to the rest.</b> Fretwork is the connector: we blend your processes, workflows, and AI into one system that actually runs.</p>
</div></section>

<!-- METHOD -->
<section class="band band-alt" id="method"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <div class="eyebrow">The Fretwork Method</div>
    <h2>A clear path from friction to a system that runs.</h2>
    <p>No vaporware, no sprawling platform. Four steps, fixed scope, a human sign-off at every gate &mdash; and a clear timeline at each one, so you always know what happens next and when.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="method-steps">
    <div class="mstep"><div class="k">01</div><h4>Audit</h4><div class="when">≈ 1&ndash;2 weeks</div><p>We map how the work actually flows and where the real friction &mdash; and the real hours &mdash; are lost.</p><div class="arrow">→</div></div>
    <div class="mstep"><div class="k">02</div><h4>Build</h4><div class="when">≈ 2&ndash;4 weeks</div><p>We connect the specific tools and steps in a focused sprint. Clear scope, clear price.</p><div class="arrow">→</div></div>
    <div class="mstep"><div class="k">03</div><h4>Embed</h4><div class="when">≈ 1&ndash;2 weeks</div><p>We wire it into how your people already work &mdash; with a human sign-off on everything that ships.</p><div class="arrow">→</div></div>
    <div class="mstep"><div class="k">04</div><h4>Hand-off</h4><div class="when">Then it&rsquo;s yours</div><p>It runs, your team owns it, and we document it. Optional managed optimization after.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- WHAT WE BUILD / PRICING -->
<section class="band" id="pricing"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head center">
    <div class="eyebrow">What we build &amp; what it costs</div>
    <h2>Productized. Scoped. Priced up front.</h2>
    <p>You&rsquo;re buying a named thing with a clear outcome &mdash; not open-ended &ldquo;consulting.&rdquo;</p>
  </div>
  <div class="ladder" id="build">
    <div class="offer">
      <span class="tag">Start here</span>
      <h3>Systems Diagnostic</h3>
      <div class="price">$1,500 &ndash; $3,000</div>
      <p>A mapped picture of how your work flows, where the hours leak, and the highest-ROI things to connect first.</p>
      <ul><li>Full workflow &amp; tooling map</li><li>Ranked automation opportunities</li><li>Fixed-scope build plan &amp; quote</li></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="offer">
      <span class="tag">Most common</span>
      <h3>Workflow Build Sprint</h3>
      <div class="price">$7,500 &ndash; $20,000</div>
      <p>We connect 3&ndash;6 workflows &mdash; intake, handoffs, approvals, docs, reporting &mdash; and leave them running.</p>
      <ul><li>Integrations + automations</li><li>AI assistants where they earn their keep</li><li>Human sign-off + documentation</li></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="offer">
      <span class="tag">Full build</span>
      <h3>Operating-System Implementation</h3>
      <div class="price">$20,000+</div>
      <p>End-to-end: your team&rsquo;s core operating system, connected and governed, built over a defined engagement.</p>
      <ul><li>6&ndash;15 workflows connected</li><li>Data &amp; reporting layer</li><li>Governance &amp; guardrails</li></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="offer">
      <span class="tag">Ongoing</span>
      <h3>Managed Optimization</h3>
      <div class="price">$2,500 &ndash; $7,500 / mo</div>
      <p>We monitor, maintain, and add new workflows monthly as your team grows.</p>
      <ul><li>Monitoring &amp; upkeep</li><li>New workflows each month</li><li>Priority support</li></ul>
    </div>
